Ports iter164f/g/h/i frontend changes from the Emergent workspace into
the Vercel-tracked repo root. Backend changes are already deployed on
belong-together.emergent.host — this PR is frontend-only.

Files (11 total):
  MOD  app/admin/dashboard/page.tsx         iter164g stale replies nudge
  MOD  app/admin/members/[id]/page.tsx      iter164h Butterfly Points wiring
  ADD  app/admin/reminders/page.tsx         iter164g cms-api refactor (new file here)
  MOD  app/admin/replies/page.tsx           iter164g resolve-without-sending + Suspense wrap*
  MOD  components/mcgs/AskGeorgeBar.tsx     iter164i Mac PWA Ask button
  MOD  components/mcgs/AskGeorgeSheet.tsx   iter164i Mac PWA Send button
  ADD  components/members/AwardPointsModal.tsx  iter164h Butterfly Points modals
  MOD  lib/cms-api.ts                       iter164g + iter164h client methods
  MOD  lib/mcgs-api.ts                      iter164f transcribe blob-aware filename
  MOD  lib/use-voice-recorder.ts            iter164f+i WKWebView belt-and-braces
  ADD  lib/mcgs-audio-singleton.ts          iter163 audio ownership registry**

*Suspense wrapper on app/admin/replies/page.tsx is a required
consequence of iter164g adding new useSearchParams-derived state.
The pristine destination built clean before the sync; adding
iter164g pushed it over Next 14's CSR-bailout threshold. Fix is
the standard <Suspense><Body/></Suspense> pattern. Zero user-
visible effect on the admin-only, always-CSR route.

**mcgs-audio-singleton.ts is an iter163 utility included here only
because the iter164i AskGeorgeSheet.tsx changes depend on it. The
destination repo is at iter161c and never received iter163.

Build result: yarn build clean (Next.js 14.2.15, 67/67 pages, 10.97s)
No backend files. No mobile Expo files. No merge, no deploy.
